Flow

Deploy-to-Cloudflare copies and deploys main.
Production receives only normal migrations/.
Create branch and Preview D1.
Add the Preview D1 binding.
Push and open PR.
Workers Builds creates the Preview.
Preview shows “schema not initialized.”
Apply workshop/preview-schema.sql by Preview database name.
Add and refresh work; delete fails visibly.
Inspect Preview Observability.
Agent fixes deletion using rowid.
Agent verifies add, refresh, and delete.
Push and let Workers Builds update the Preview.
Merge.
Production deploys compatible code without applying any schema change.